        "instructions": "Implement `HyperLogLog._ertl()` in `hll.js`. Build the register-value histogram `C[0..q+1]` where `q = 64 - this.p`. Initialize `z = m * tau(1 - C[q + 1] / m)`, fold `z = 0.5 * (z + C[k])` for `k = q` down to `1`, add `m * sigma(C[0] / m)`, and return `m * m / (2 * Math.LN2 * z)`.",
        "targetFile": "hll.js",
